OL,3,GNEWSATheatre turns 'extraordinary
OL,4,Aideas' into new shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre that has created original
OL,7,Fproductions for nearly two decades has
OL,8,Fincubated "extraordinary ideas that
OL,9,Fwill have a future life", its artistic
OL,10,Fdirector has said.
OL,12,FJesse Jones said the Royal and
OL,13,FDerngate's Made In Northampton series
OL,14,Faimed to highlight the different voices
OL,15,Fin the town and celebrate its
OL,16,Fdiversity, with some shows going on to
OL,17,Fthe West End and Broadway.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
