OL,3,GNEWSATheatre turns 'extraordinary
OL,4,Aideas' into new shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts latest production, Once Upon a Time
OL,7,Fin Sokoto, explores the birth of modern
OL,8,FNigeria, which Jones hoped would
OL,9,Fresonate with the town's west African
OL,10,Fpopulation.
OL,12,FThe theatre has also received praised
OL,13,Fas an "excellent case in point" for how
OL,14,Fvenues can combine local interest with
OL,15,Fglobal success.
